1
  3
NOTES\P1. The 3D model pet_case.step (source pet_case.step.py) is the\Pmaster; undimensioned features per model.\P2. FDM, PETG, 0.4 nozzle, 0.12-0.16 layers, 3-4 walls, 30 %\Pinfill.\P3. Angles are CCW from +X, seen from the front (display side).\P4.
  3
 Display clamp legs 4x %%c2.4 at 60/120/205/335 deg press on\Pthe display PCB edge.\P5. Key tabs 2x 3.4 wide at 45/135 deg (fit the housing key\Pchannels, one way only).\P6. Hook notches 4x 4.8 wide to R17.9 at 0/180/225/315 deg.\P7. XIAO tape pad 8 
  1
x 8 x 1.0 high for 0.5 mm double-sided tape;\Pstop rib 12 wide at the antenna end. Battery ribs 0.8 thick x 2\Phigh.\P8. Print battery ribs down, supports touching the bed only.
  7
