  3
NOTES\P1. The 3D model pet_case.step (source pet_case.step.py) is the\Pmaster; undimensioned features per model.\P2. FDM, PETG, 0.4 nozzle, 0.12-0.16 layers, 3-4 walls, 30 %\Pinfill.\P3. Angles are CCW from +X, seen from the front (display side).\P4.
  3
 Perimeter snap hooks 4x 4 wide at 0/180/225/315 deg, profile\Pper detail E.\P5. Tab-tip hooks 2x 2 wide at X = +-10, same profile, rising\Pfrom the tab plate.\P6. Posts 4x %%c2 at 30/150/210/330 deg clamp the midframe (top\Pat 5.7 from the outside f
  1
ace).\P7. Retention ramp 45 deg: the cover is removable (pry at the\Phousing notch, 225 deg).\P8. Print disc down; support under the tab plate.
  7
